Package: maclinos-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 maclinos-plasma-theme,
 maclinos-icons,
 maclinos-cursors,
 maclinos-wallpapers,
 maclinos-sddm-theme
Recommends: maclinos-defaults,
 maclinos-kwin-scripts
Description: MaclinOS Desktop Theme (metapackage)
 A macOS-inspired desktop theme for KDE Plasma on Debian.
 This metapackage installs all MaclinOS theme components including
 color schemes, window decorations, icons, cursors, wallpapers,
 and the SDDM login theme.
 .
 MaclinOS provides an attractive, cohesive macOS-inspired experience
 while preserving the full Linux operating system underneath.

Package: maclinos-plasma-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plasma-desktop
Description: MaclinOS Plasma Theme
 KDE Plasma global theme, color schemes, desktop theme,
 and window decorations for MaclinOS.

Package: maclinos-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MaclinOS Icon Theme
 Original icon theme for MaclinOS, providing consistent
 icons across the desktop environment.

Package: maclinos-cursors
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MaclinOS Cursor Theme
 Custom cursor theme for MaclinOS.

Package: maclinos-wallpapers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MaclinOS Wallpapers
 Collection of original wallpapers for MaclinOS.

Package: maclinos-sddm-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sddm
Description: MaclinOS SDDM Login Theme
 macOS-inspired SDDM login and lock screen theme.
